WEBVTT

52:31.717 --> 52:35.846
Lady Stark!
What an unexpected pleasure.

52:36.555 --> 52:39.349
I was sorry to have
missed you at Winterfell.

52:39.474 --> 52:41.268
Lady Stark!

52:49.192 --> 52:53.864
I was still Catelyn Tully
the last time I stayed here.

52:56.324 --> 52:58.493
You, ser.

52:59.286 --> 53:03.665
Is that the black bat of Harrenhal
I see embroidered on your coat?
